{"id":"en_trapped-in-a-lover-s-game-with-my-ceo","title":"Trapped In a Lover’s Game With My CEO","titleEn":"Trapped In a Lover’s Game With My CEO","description":"A safety disagreement costs maintenance worker Ethan his job when hotel CEO Vanessa dismisses him. Yet the two are soon imprisoned together in a lethal escape room designed for couples, engineered by an unseen adversary. To stay alive they must work through a string of intimate, high-stakes trials, and the class divide between them slowly erodes as they depend on one another. The person behind it all proves to be Julian, Vanessa's fiancé, who wants power and their destruction. Facing death, neither will flee alone; together they gather proof of his wrongdoing and reveal the scheme. They ultimately escape, leaving class barriers behind and choosing each other.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/trapped-in-a-lovers-game-with-my-ceo/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/trapped-in-a-lovers-game-with-my-ceo/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fantasy","Romance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dinp4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_trapped-in-a-lover-s-game-with-my-ceo_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dinp4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_trapped-in-a-lover-s-game-with-my-ceo_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dinp4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_trapped-in-a-lover-s-game-with-my-ceo_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dinp4/?pub=4occak","kin